/code></td><td><code>20.31.74.16</code> - <code>20.31.74.23</code></td></tr><tr><td>EU</td><td>germanywestcentral (Frankfurt)</td><td><code>20.79.135.80/29</code></td><td><code>20.79.135.80</code> - <code>20.79.135.87</code></td></tr><tr><td>Middle East</td><td>uaenorth (Dubai)<br/>Default region</td><td><code>20.233.73.80/29</code></td><td><code>20.233.73.80</code> - <code>20.233.73.87</code></td></tr><tr><td>Singapore</td><td>southeastasia (Singapore)</td><td><code>104.43.99.136/29</code></td><td><code>104.43.99.136</code> - <code>104.43.99.143</code></td></tr><tr><td>Japan</td><td>japaneast (Tokyo)</td><td><code>52.155.112.248/29</code></td><td><code>52.155.112.248</code> - <code>52.155.112.255</code></td></tr><tr><td>India</td><td>centralindia (Pune)</td><td><code>20.235.195.248/29</code></td><td><code>20.235.195.249</code> - <code>20.235.195.254</code></td></tr><tr><td>Switzerland</td><td>switzerlandnorth (Zurich)</td><td><code>74.161.48.104/29</code></td><td><code>74.161.48.105</code> - <code>74.161.48.110</code></td></tr><tr><td>South Korea</td><td>koreacentral (Seoul)</td><td><code>20.196.249.184/29</code></td><td><code>20.196.249.184</code> - <code>20.196.249.191</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>If we are missing a region that you need, <a href="https://support.fivetran.com/hc/en-us/requests/new">contact our support team</a>.</p><p><span id="webhooksusers"></span></p><h2 id="fivetranapplicationipaddresses">Fivetran application IP addresses<a href="#fivetranapplicationipaddresses" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconWrapper Icon-module__q3WqRG__inlineBlock Icon-module__q3WqRG__containerSizeInherit HeadingLink-module-scss-module__2FEewG__linkIcon"><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon-module__q3WqRG__icon Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconSizeInherit" data-icon="link-simple" data-prefix="far" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></h2><p>Fivetran uses the following application IP addresses for requests that originate outside your data processing location. These IP addresses are the same across all data processing locations and are not part of your region&#x27;s IP range.</p><p>In addition to your region&#x27;s IP addresses, safelist these IP addresses if any of the following applies:</p><ul><li>You use IP-based authentication for webhooks. Fivetran validates the URL of your webhook-receiving endpoint and sends webhook events from these IP addresses.</li><li>Your source or identity provider restricts OAuth requests by IP. Fivetran uses these IP addresses for OAuth flows.</li><li>Your source restricts access by IP, and you set up or edit connections in the Fivetran dashboard. Some setup form fields, such as drop-down menus that retrieve values from your source, send requests from these IP addresses.</li></ul><div class="Table-module-scss-module__1aIlAq__table"><table><thead><tr><th>IP Addresses (CIDR)</th><th>IP Addresses (Range)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>34.85.252.27/32</code></td><td><code>34.85.252.27</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>35.197.105.90/32</code></td><td><code>35.197.105.90</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>136.107.62.136/29</code></td><td><code>136.107.62.136 - 136.107.62.143</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>136.118.115.24/29</code></td><td><code>136.118.115.24 - 136.118.115.31</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id="fivetranproxyusers">Fivetran Proxy users<a href="#fivetranproxyusers" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconWrapper Icon-module__q3WqRG__inlineBlock Icon-module__q3WqRG__containerSizeInherit HeadingLink-module-scss-module__2FEewG__linkIcon"><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon-module__q3WqRG__icon Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconSizeInherit" data-icon="link-simple" data-prefix="far" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></h2><p>Fivetran Proxy uses a wildcard domain to route traffic through our proxy servers. Your connection to Fivetran Proxy may communicate with any subdomain of the <a href="#allprovidersandregions">following wildcard domains</a>. Each wildcard domain resolves to a set of IP addresses that may change over time.</p><p>The <code>orchestrator.fivetran.com</code> hostname is the Proxy Broker. The region-specific wildcard hostnames listed below are the Proxy Server hostnames for the corresponding cloud providers and regions.</p><h3 id="configureyourfirewallortrafficfilteringdevice">Configure your firewall or traffic filtering device<a href="#configureyourfirewallortrafficfilteringdevice" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconWrapper Icon-module__q3WqRG__inlineBlock Icon-module__q3WqRG__containerSizeInherit HeadingLink-module-scss-module__2FEewG__linkIcon"><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon-module__q3WqRG__icon Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconSizeInherit" data-icon="link-simple" data-prefix="far" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></h3><p>If your firewall or traffic filtering device supports restricting traffic by domain or hostname, add the <a href="#allprovidersandregions">following domains</a> to your safelist.</p><p>If your firewall or traffic filtering device does <em>not</em> support restricting traffic by domain or hostname, resolve the current IP addresses of the <a href="#allprovidersandregions">following domains</a> and add them to your safelist. The IP addresses may change in the future without notice.</p><h3 id="allprovidersandregions">All providers and regions<a href="#allprovidersandregions" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconWrapper Icon-module__q3WqRG__inlineBlock Icon-module__q3WqRG__containerSizeInherit HeadingLink-module-scss-module__2FEewG__linkIcon"><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon-module__q3WqRG__icon Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconSizeInherit" data-icon="link-simple" data-prefix="far" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></h3><p>For every provider and region, you must safelist the following domain:</p><div class="Table-module-scss-module__1aIlAq__table"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Hostname</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Proxy Broker</td><td><code>orchestrator.fivetran.com</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Next, safelist the domains required for your cloud service provider:</p><h3 id="googlecloudplatform_1">Google Cloud Platform<a href="#googlecloudplatform_1" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconWrapper Icon-module__q3WqRG__inlineBlock Icon-module__q3WqRG__containerSizeInherit HeadingLink-module-scss-module__2FEewG__linkIcon"><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon-module__q3WqRG__icon Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconSizeInherit" data-icon="link-simple" data-prefix="far" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C71.6 416 0 344.4 0 256zm576 0c0 88.4-71.6 160-160 160H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112s-50.1-112-112-112H344c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h72c88.4 0 160 71.6 160 160zM184 232H392c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a></h3><div class="Table-module-scss-module__1aIlAq__table"><table><thead><tr><th>Geography</th><th>Region</th><th>Hostname</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>US</td><td>us-east4 (N. Virginia)</td><td><code>*.us-east4.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>US</td><td>us-west1 (Oregon)</td><td><code>*.us-west1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>US</td><td>us-central1 (Iowa)</td><td><code>*.us-central1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>EU</td><td>europe-west3 (Frankfurt)</td><td><code>*.europe-west3.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Australia</td><td>australia-southeast-1 (Sydney)</td><td><code>*.australia-southeast1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>UK</td><td>europe-west2 (London)</td><td><code>*.europe-west2.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Canada</td><td>northamerica-northeast1 (Montréal)</td><td><code>*.northamerica-northeast1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Singapore</td><td>asia-southeast1  (Singapore)</td><td><code>*.asia-southeast1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>India</td><td>asia-south1 (Mumbai)</td><td><code>*.asia-south1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Japan</td><td>asia-northeast1 (Tokyo)</td><td><code>*.asia-northeast1.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr><tr><td>Indonesia</td><td>asia-southeast2 (Jakarta)</td><td><code>*.asia-southeast2.gcp.proxy.prod.fivetran.com</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id="aws_1">AWS<a href="#aws_1" class="deep-link" aria-label="Copy link to the clipboard" data-state="closed"><span class="Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconWrapper Icon-module__q3WqRG__inlineBlock Icon-module__q3WqRG__containerSizeInherit HeadingLink-module-scss-module__2FEewG__linkIcon"><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-link-simple Icon-module__q3WqRG__icon Icon-module__q3WqRG__iconSizeInherit" data-icon="link-simple" data-prefix="far" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 256C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 144 48 194.1 48 256s50.1 112 112 112h72c13.3 0 24 10